{"zh": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch2\" style=\"--acc:var(--org)\">\n\n<p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Five Common Retrieval Capabilities in Enterprise RAG\" data-i18n-zh=\"企业 RAG 常见的五种检索能力\">企业 RAG 常见的五种检索能力</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"They are not substitutes for one another; they solve different problems\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是互相替代，而是解决不同问题\">不是互相替代，而是解决不同问题</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\": identifiers, terminology, semantics, relationships, and scope.\" data-i18n-zh=\"：标识符、术语、语义、关系、范围。\">：标识符、术语、语义、关系、范围。</span></p>\n<div class=\"grid g5 rv\">\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">EXACT</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"For structured fields / normalized strings, use\" data-i18n-zh=\"对结构化字段 / 规范化字符串做\">对结构化字段 / 规范化字符串做</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"deterministic matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"确定性匹配\">确定性匹配</span></strong>。keyword field、term query、PK lookup、hash、alias。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"order IDs · error codes · part numbers · VIN · SKU · API names · version numbers\" data-i18n-zh=\"订单号 · 错误码 · 零件号 · VIN · SKU · API 名 · 版本号\">订单号 · 错误码 · 零件号 · VIN · SKU · API 名 · 版本号</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--org)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">BM25</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Inverted index,\" data-i18n-zh=\"倒排索引，\">倒排索引，</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"lexical relevance\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法相关性\">词法相关性</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Ranking by term frequency, rarity, and document length.\" data-i18n-zh=\"排序：词频、稀有度、文档长度。\">排序：词频、稀有度、文档长度。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"domain terms · product names · error descriptions · technical / API / regulatory documents · function names\" data-i18n-zh=\"专业术语 · 产品名 · 错误描述 · 技术 / API / 法规文档 · 函数名\">专业术语 · 产品名 · 错误描述 · 技术 / API / 法规文档 · 函数名</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--grn)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">DENSE</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Encode the Query and documents as embeddings, then use\" data-i18n-zh=\"Query 与文档编码为 Embedding，\">Query 与文档编码为 Embedding，</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"向量相似度\">向量相似度</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find semantically similar content.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找语义接近内容。\">找语义接近内容。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"natural-language Q&amp;A · colloquial phrasing · synonyms · users unfamiliar with terminology · cross-language queries\" data-i18n-zh=\"自然语言问答 · 口语化 · 同义词 · 用户不懂术语 · 跨语言\">自然语言问答 · 口语化 · 同义词 · 用户不懂术语 · 跨语言</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--pur)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">GRAPH</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Instead of searching for “which text looks most similar,”\" data-i18n-zh=\"不搜“哪段文字最像”，而是\">不搜“哪段文字最像”，而是</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"traverse entity relationships\" data-i18n-zh=\"沿实体关系\">沿实体关系</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find the answer. Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找答案。Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph。\">找答案。Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph。</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">适合</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · org structures · dependencies · multi-hop reasoning · impact analysis\" data-i18n-zh=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · 组织结构 · 依赖 · 多跳推理 · 影响分析\">BOM · ERP/PLM · 组织结构 · 依赖 · 多跳推理 · 影响分析</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--tea)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">META</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"It does not understand the answer itself; it is responsible for\" data-i18n-zh=\"本身不理解答案，负责\">本身不理解答案，负责</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"narrowing the search space first\" data-i18n-zh=\"先缩小搜索范围\">先缩小搜索范围</span></strong>。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fields\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段\">字段</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · confidentiality level\" data-i18n-zh=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · 密级\">tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · 密级</span></small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tsc rv interp-matrix\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table id=\"comparison\">\n<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Capability\" data-i18n-zh=\"能力\">能力</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"原理\">原理</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Strengths\" data-i18n-zh=\"优势\">优势</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Limitations / Traps\" data-i18n-zh=\"局限 / 陷阱\">局限 / 陷阱</span></th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><b>Exact</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Deterministic field matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段确定性匹配\">字段确定性匹配</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, stable, and explainable\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、稳定、可解释\">快、稳定、可解释</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand paraphrases or synonyms; “exact” matching usually still requires normalization (E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase, remove spaces, normalize hyphens, alias mapping)\" data-i18n-zh=\"不懂改写与同义；“精确”通常也需要规范化（E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase、去空格、连字符、alias）\">不懂改写与同义；“精确”通常也需要规范化（E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase、去空格、连字符、alias）</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>BM25</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Lexical matching + relevance ranking\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法匹配 + 相关性排序\">词法匹配 + 相关性排序</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, cheap, explainable, and sensitive to rare terms\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、便宜、可解释、对稀有词敏感\">快、便宜、可解释、对稀有词敏感</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand semantics; “How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” may have weak recall when lexical overlap is low;\" data-i18n-zh=\"不理解语义；“How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” 词重合少则召回差；\">不理解语义；“How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” 词重合少则召回差；</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"not a primary-key lookup\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是主键查询\">不是主键查询</span></mark></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Dense</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Embedding vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"Embedding 向量相似度\">Embedding 向量相似度</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Handles paraphrases and finds semantically similar content with different wording\" data-i18n-zh=\"处理改写、发现词面不同但语义相近的内容\">处理改写、发现词面不同但语义相近的内容</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unstable for identifiers / version numbers;\" data-i18n-zh=\"对编号 / 版本号不稳；\">对编号 / 版本号不稳；</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"cancel subscription and renew subscription are topically similar but semantically opposite in action\" data-i18n-zh=\"cancel subscription 与 renew subscription 主题相近但动作相反\">cancel subscription 与 renew subscription 主题相近但动作相反</span></mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"; changing the embedding model requires rebuilding the index\" data-i18n-zh=\"；换模型需重建索引\">；换模型需重建索引</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Graph</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Entity-relation traversal\" data-i18n-zh=\"实体关系遍历\">实体关系遍历</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Multi-hop and impact analysis: Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\" data-i18n-zh=\"多跳与影响分析：Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\">多跳与影响分析：Supplier A → Material X → Product Y</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Requires entity/relation construction first; entity disambiguation and updates are costly\" data-i18n-zh=\"需先建实体与关系；实体消歧与更新成本高\">需先建实体与关系；实体消歧与更新成本高</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Metadata</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Attribute filtering\" data-i18n-zh=\"属性过滤\">属性过滤</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reduces irrelevant recall, prevents stale-version contamination, isolates tenants, and improves latency/cost\" data-i18n-zh=\"降无关召回、防旧版本污染、多租户隔离、改善延迟成本\">降无关召回、防旧版本污染、多租户隔离、改善延迟成本</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Overly strict relevance filters can hurt recall; tenant and ACL constraints must never be relaxed to improve recall\" data-i18n-zh=\"相关性过滤过严会漏召回；Tenant / ACL 授权约束不能为召回率让步\">相关性过滤过严会漏召回；Tenant / ACL 授权约束不能为召回率让步</span></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas rv\" id=\"fig-2-1\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.2.1</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">元数据过滤优先：先授权，再语义</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-grid bfs-g4\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"User: What is the German refund policy for 2026?\" data-i18n-zh=\"用户：2026 年德国退款政策？\">用户：2026 年德国退款政策？</span></h2></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-teal\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">country = Germany</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">valid_year = 2026<br/>document_type = policy</div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 3</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">BM25 / Dense</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Retrieve only within the authorized candidate space\" data-i18n-zh=\"在授权候选空间内检索\">在授权候选空间内检索</span></div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-emerald\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 4</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Answer</h2></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co must rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Must Remember ×3\" data-i18n-zh=\"必背 ×3\">必背 ×3</span></span>\n<p class=\"say\">Exact retrieval is best for identifiers, but it usually requires field-aware indexing and normalization.</p>\n<p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">BM25 handles lexical relevance; it is strong for terminology but weaker for paraphrases.</p>\n<p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Dense retrieval handles meaning, but semantic similarity is not the same as factual or operational equivalence.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co note rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Key Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"关键原则\">关键原则</span></span><p><strong>Authorization before semantic similarity.</strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\" Unauthorized documents must not enter the model context.\" data-i18n-zh=\" 未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文。\"> 未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文。</span></p></div>\n</section>\n\n<details class=\"co note verification-note\" id=\"verification-02-20260928\"><summary class=\"co-t\">2026-09-28 · <span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verification boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"验证边界\">验证边界</span></summary><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Exact normalization must preserve business identity, and ACLs cannot be relaxed for recall. Dense retrieval performance depends on the domain and model; GraphRAG also supports global questions through community summaries.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Exact 规范化必须保留业务身份差异；ACL 不可为 Recall 放宽。Dense 的相对表现依赖数据域与模型；GraphRAG 还可利用社区摘要回答全局问题。\">Exact 规范化必须保留业务身份差异；ACL 不可为 Recall 放宽。Dense 的相对表现依赖数据域与模型；GraphRAG 还可利用社区摘要回答全局问题。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08663\">BEIR</a></p></details>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"fde-verified-permission-rag-title\" id=\"fde-verified-permission-rag\"><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-verified-permission-rag-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Permission-Aware RAG: three independently verified interview answers\" data-i18n-zh=\"Permission-Aware RAG：三道有证据的面试题\">Permission-Aware RAG：三道有证据的面试题</span> <small>§2.FDE</small></h2><p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Enterprise RAG can fail through unauthorized reads before relevance failures. Separate trusted identity, candidate filtering, retrieval quality and permission propagation.\" data-i18n-zh=\"企业 RAG 最危险的失败未必是召回不足，而是越权读取。区分授权身份、候选集过滤、检索质量与数据权限更新。\">企业 RAG 最危险的失败未必是召回不足，而是越权读取。区分授权身份、候选集过滤、检索质量与数据权限更新。</span></p><aside class=\"co note rv\"><span class=\"co-t\">SOURCE BOUNDARY</span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"These independently authored questions and answers derive from public FDE topics, not from any private paid answer. Platform facts follow first-party references; design advice is handbook synthesis.\" data-i18n-zh=\"以下是根据 FDE 网站公开考点独立撰写的问题与答案，不是付费题目的官方答案。产品细节以链接的官方文档为准；设计建议属于 Handbook 综合判断。\">以下是根据 FDE 网站公开考点独立撰写的问题与答案，不是付费题目的官方答案。产品细节以链接的官方文档为准；设计建议属于 Handbook 综合判断。</span></p></aside><h3 id=\"fde-qa-auth\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q1 · How do you prevent cross-tenant RAG leakage?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q1 · 如何确保 RAG 不泄漏其他租户的文档？\">Q1 · 如何确保 RAG 不泄漏其他租户的文档？</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Validate the caller with trusted identity infrastructure and constrain eligible documents before reranking, prompting, caching or logging. The LLM cannot grant access.\" data-i18n-zh=\"由可信服务验证身份并计算有效权限，在检索前约束合法候选集；授权通过后才能进入 rerank、LLM context、缓存与日志。模型不能自行决定谁有权限。\">由可信服务验证身份并计算有效权限，在检索前约束合法候选集；授权通过后才能进入 rerank、LLM context、缓存与日志。模型不能自行决定谁有权限。</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Trusted caller identity → policy/tenant scope\n→ authorized retrieval candidates\n→ authorized rerank → evidence → answer\n→ tenant-scoped cache, redacted traces</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"风险\">风险</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Test\" data-i18n-zh=\"必须验证\">必须验证</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mixed-tenant documents\" data-i18n-zh=\"混合租户文档\">混合租户文档</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"No forbidden material in candidates, prompt or logs\" data-i18n-zh=\"候选集、Prompt、日志全部不出现越权文档\">候选集、Prompt、日志全部不出现越权文档</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Stale ACL / shared cache\" data-i18n-zh=\"旧 ACL / 共享缓存\">旧 ACL / 共享缓存</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Revocation reflected in caches and source checks\" data-i18n-zh=\"撤权后缓存与源内容一致地拒绝访问\">撤权后缓存与源内容一致地拒绝访问</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Model-supplied tenant_id\" data-i18n-zh=\"模型传入 tenant_id\">模型传入 tenant_id</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Agent cannot override trusted tenant identity\" data-i18n-zh=\"请求身份不得由模型覆盖\">请求身份不得由模型覆盖</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"核心判断\">核心判断</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A security filter is a query predicate, not authentication: Microsoft's string-based security trimming does not itself validate identity.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Security filter 是查询条件，不是认证机制。Azure 文档明确说明基于字符串的 security-trimming 不提供身份认证本身。\">Security filter 是查询条件，不是认证机制。Azure 文档明确说明基于字符串的 security-trimming 不提供身份认证本身。</span></p></aside>\n<h3 id=\"fde-qa-pre-post\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q2 · What changes when you pre-filter versus post-filter vector search?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q2 · 向量检索的 Pre-filter 与 Post-filter 哪个更可靠？\">Q2 · 向量检索的 Pre-filter 与 Post-filter 哪个更可靠？</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If a user can see 1% of the index, global top-k followed by filtering can return nothing despite a valid answer in the authorized subset. Prefiltering improves authorized recall but may increase ANN traversal cost.\" data-i18n-zh=\"当用户只可见 1% 文档时，先全局 top-k 后过滤可能得到空结果，即使可访问集合内有答案。Pre-filter 可改善授权集合内召回，但高度选择性的过滤可能增加 ANN 遍历成本。\">当用户只可见 1% 文档时，先全局 top-k 后过滤可能得到空结果，即使可访问集合内有答案。Pre-filter 可改善授权集合内召回，但高度选择性的过滤可能增加 ANN 遍历成本。</span></p>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mode\" data-i18n-zh=\"方法\">方法</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consequence\" data-i18n-zh=\"效果与取舍\">效果与取舍</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Pre-filter\" data-i18n-zh=\"Pre-filter\">Pre-filter</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Search eligible corpus; selective predicates can cost more\" data-i18n-zh=\"合法候选集内检索；选择性高时成本上涨\">合法候选集内检索；选择性高时成本上涨</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Post-filter\" data-i18n-zh=\"Post-filter\">Post-filter</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ANN first; small k can miss permitted relevant documents\" data-i18n-zh=\"先 ANN 后过滤；小 k 易漏掉合法相关文档\">先 ANN 后过滤；小 k 易漏掉合法相关文档</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Strict post-filter (preview)\" data-i18n-zh=\"Strict post-filter（预览）\">Strict post-filter（预览）</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Filter global top-k; highest false-negative risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"全局 top-k 后过滤；对高选择性权限风险最大\">全局 top-k 后过滤；对高选择性权限风险最大</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"fde-qa-revoke\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q3 · How do you handle source ACL revocation after indexing?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q3 · 权限撤销之后如何防止旧索引仍然放行？\">Q3 · 权限撤销之后如何防止旧索引仍然放行？</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Measure source-to-index ACL sync lag and reauthorize document fetches where necessary. Define revocation-to-denial objectives covering caches, async jobs and citations; fail closed for sensitive content when policy freshness is unknown.\" data-i18n-zh=\"追踪源权限到索引的同步窗口，必要时在取回源文档时重新授权；建立撤权到拒绝的 SLO，并对缓存、异步任务和引用执行隔离。无法确认权限版本时对敏感资源 fail closed。\">追踪源权限到索引的同步窗口，必要时在取回源文档时重新授权；建立撤权到拒绝的 SLO，并对缓存、异步任务和引用执行隔离。无法确认权限版本时对敏感资源 fail closed。</span></p>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"核心判断\">核心判断</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Critical regression: after Alice loses access, neither the index, cache nor downstream tool may return the revoked document.\" data-i18n-zh=\"最关键的回归测试：Alice 已撤权，搜索索引、缓存和下游工具都不能再次向她提供旧文档。\">最关键的回归测试：Alice 已撤权，搜索索引、缓存和下游工具都不能再次向她提供旧文档。</span></p></aside>\n<p class=\"rv\"><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verified first-party sources\" data-i18n-zh=\"官方核验来源\">官方核验来源</span>: <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-document-level-access-overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Azure document ACL</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-security-trimming-for-azure-search\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Security trimming</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/vector-search-filters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Vector filter modes</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/hybrid-search-how-to-query\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hybrid override</a></small></p></section>\n</div>", "en": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch2\" style=\"--acc:var(--org)\">\n<p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Five Common Retrieval Capabilities in Enterprise RAG\" data-i18n-zh=\"企业 RAG 常见的五种检索能力\">Five Common Retrieval Capabilities in Enterprise RAG</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"They are not substitutes for one another; they solve different problems\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是互相替代，而是解决不同问题\">They are not substitutes for one another; they solve different problems</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\": identifiers, terminology, semantics, relationships, and scope.\" data-i18n-zh=\"：标识符、术语、语义、关系、范围。\">: identifiers, terminology, semantics, relationships, and scope.</span></p>\n<div class=\"grid g5 rv\">\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--blu)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">EXACT</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"For structured fields / normalized strings, use\" data-i18n-zh=\"对结构化字段 / 规范化字符串做\">For structured fields / normalized strings, use</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"deterministic matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"确定性匹配\">deterministic matching</span></strong>。keyword field、term query、PK lookup、hash、alias。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">Suitable for</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"order IDs · error codes · part numbers · VIN · SKU · API names · version numbers\" data-i18n-zh=\"订单号 · 错误码 · 零件号 · VIN · SKU · API 名 · 版本号\">order IDs · error codes · part numbers · VIN · SKU · API names · version numbers</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--org)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">BM25</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Inverted index,\" data-i18n-zh=\"倒排索引，\">Inverted index,</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"lexical relevance\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法相关性\">lexical relevance</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Ranking by term frequency, rarity, and document length.\" data-i18n-zh=\"排序：词频、稀有度、文档长度。\">Ranking by term frequency, rarity, and document length.</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">Suitable for</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"domain terms · product names · error descriptions · technical / API / regulatory documents · function names\" data-i18n-zh=\"专业术语 · 产品名 · 错误描述 · 技术 / API / 法规文档 · 函数名\">domain terms · product names · error descriptions · technical / API / regulatory documents · function names</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--grn)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">DENSE</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Encode the Query and documents as embeddings, then use\" data-i18n-zh=\"Query 与文档编码为 Embedding，\">Encode the Query and documents as embeddings, then use</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"向量相似度\">vector similarity</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find semantically similar content.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找语义接近内容。\">to find semantically similar content.</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">Suitable for</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"natural-language Q&amp;A · colloquial phrasing · synonyms · users unfamiliar with terminology · cross-language queries\" data-i18n-zh=\"自然语言问答 · 口语化 · 同义词 · 用户不懂术语 · 跨语言\">natural-language Q&amp;A · colloquial phrasing · synonyms · users unfamiliar with terminology · cross-language queries</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--pur)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">GRAPH</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Instead of searching for “which text looks most similar,”\" data-i18n-zh=\"不搜“哪段文字最像”，而是\">Instead of searching for “which text looks most similar,”</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"traverse entity relationships\" data-i18n-zh=\"沿实体关系\">traverse entity relationships</span></strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"to find the answer. Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph.\" data-i18n-zh=\"找答案。Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph。\">to find the answer. Neo4j / SPARQL / Property Graph.</span></small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Suitable for\" data-i18n-zh=\"适合\">Suitable for</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · org structures · dependencies · multi-hop reasoning · impact analysis\" data-i18n-zh=\"BOM · ERP/PLM · 组织结构 · 依赖 · 多跳推理 · 影响分析\">BOM · ERP/PLM · org structures · dependencies · multi-hop reasoning · impact analysis</span></small></div>\n<div class=\"cd\" style=\"--c:var(--tea)\"><div class=\"cd-h\"><span class=\"ic\">META</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"It does not understand the answer itself; it is responsible for\" data-i18n-zh=\"本身不理解答案，负责\">It does not understand the answer itself; it is responsible for</span><strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"narrowing the search space first\" data-i18n-zh=\"先缩小搜索范围\">narrowing the search space first</span></strong>。</small><div class=\"lb\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fields\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段\">Fields</span></div><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · confidentiality level\" data-i18n-zh=\"tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · 密级\">tenant · role · country · language · doc type · version · effective date · confidentiality level</span></small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tsc rv interp-matrix\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table id=\"comparison\">\n<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Capability\" data-i18n-zh=\"能力\">Capability</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"原理\">Principle</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Strengths\" data-i18n-zh=\"优势\">Strengths</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Limitations / Traps\" data-i18n-zh=\"局限 / 陷阱\">Limitations / Traps</span></th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><b>Exact</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Deterministic field matching\" data-i18n-zh=\"字段确定性匹配\">Deterministic field matching</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, stable, and explainable\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、稳定、可解释\">Fast, stable, and explainable</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand paraphrases or synonyms; “exact” matching usually still requires normalization (E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase, remove spaces, normalize hyphens, alias mapping)\" data-i18n-zh=\"不懂改写与同义；“精确”通常也需要规范化（E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase、去空格、连字符、alias）\">Does not understand paraphrases or synonyms; “exact” matching usually still requires normalization (E4307 / E-4307 / Error E 4307 → uppercase, remove spaces, normalize hyphens, alias mapping)</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>BM25</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Lexical matching + relevance ranking\" data-i18n-zh=\"词法匹配 + 相关性排序\">Lexical matching + relevance ranking</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fast, cheap, explainable, and sensitive to rare terms\" data-i18n-zh=\"快、便宜、可解释、对稀有词敏感\">Fast, cheap, explainable, and sensitive to rare terms</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Does not understand semantics; “How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” may have weak recall when lexical overlap is low;\" data-i18n-zh=\"不理解语义；“How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” 词重合少则召回差；\">Does not understand semantics; “How can I get my money back?” vs “Refund and reimbursement policy” may have weak recall when lexical overlap is low;</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"not a primary-key lookup\" data-i18n-zh=\"不是主键查询\">not a primary-key lookup</span></mark></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Dense</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Embedding vector similarity\" data-i18n-zh=\"Embedding 向量相似度\">Embedding vector similarity</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Handles paraphrases and finds semantically similar content with different wording\" data-i18n-zh=\"处理改写、发现词面不同但语义相近的内容\">Handles paraphrases and finds semantically similar content with different wording</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unstable for identifiers / version numbers;\" data-i18n-zh=\"对编号 / 版本号不稳；\">Unstable for identifiers / version numbers;</span><mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"cancel subscription and renew subscription are topically similar but semantically opposite in action\" data-i18n-zh=\"cancel subscription 与 renew subscription 主题相近但动作相反\">cancel subscription and renew subscription are topically similar but semantically opposite in action</span></mark><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"; changing the embedding model requires rebuilding the index\" data-i18n-zh=\"；换模型需重建索引\">; changing the embedding model requires rebuilding the index</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Graph</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Entity-relation traversal\" data-i18n-zh=\"实体关系遍历\">Entity-relation traversal</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Multi-hop and impact analysis: Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\" data-i18n-zh=\"多跳与影响分析：Supplier A → Material X → Product Y\">Multi-hop and impact analysis: Supplier A → Material X → Product Y</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Requires entity/relation construction first; entity disambiguation and updates are costly\" data-i18n-zh=\"需先建实体与关系；实体消歧与更新成本高\">Requires entity/relation construction first; entity disambiguation and updates are costly</span></td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>Metadata</b></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Attribute filtering\" data-i18n-zh=\"属性过滤\">Attribute filtering</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reduces irrelevant recall, prevents stale-version contamination, isolates tenants, and improves latency/cost\" data-i18n-zh=\"降无关召回、防旧版本污染、多租户隔离、改善延迟成本\">Reduces irrelevant recall, prevents stale-version contamination, isolates tenants, and improves latency/cost</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Overly strict relevance filters can hurt recall; tenant and ACL constraints must never be relaxed to improve recall\" data-i18n-zh=\"相关性过滤过严会漏召回；Tenant / ACL 授权约束不能为召回率让步\">Overly strict relevance filters can hurt recall; tenant and ACL constraints must never be relaxed to improve recall</span></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-canvas rv\" id=\"fig-2-1\">\n<div class=\"bfs-head\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"bfs-tag\"><span class=\"bfs-tag-dot\"></span>FIG.2.1</span>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-title\">Metadata filtering first: authorize before semantic retrieval</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bfs-body\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n<div class=\"bfs-grid bfs-g4\"><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-blue\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 1</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"User: What is the German refund policy for 2026?\" data-i18n-zh=\"用户：2026 年德国退款政策？\">User: What is the German refund policy for 2026?</span></h2></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-teal\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 2</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">country = Germany</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\">valid_year = 2026<br/>document_type = policy</div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-amber\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 3</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">BM25 / Dense</h2><div class=\"bfs-card-desc\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Retrieve only within the authorized candidate space\" data-i18n-zh=\"在授权候选空间内检索\">Retrieve only within the authorized candidate space</span></div></div><div class=\"bfs-card bfs-emerald\">\n<div class=\"bfs-strip\"></div>\n<div class=\"bfs-card-head\"><span class=\"bfs-stage-pill\">STEP 4</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"bfs-card-title\">Answer</h2></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co must rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Must Remember ×3\" data-i18n-zh=\"必背 ×3\">Must Remember ×3</span></span>\n<p class=\"say\">Exact retrieval is best for identifiers, but it usually requires field-aware indexing and normalization.</p>\n<p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">BM25 handles lexical relevance; it is strong for terminology but weaker for paraphrases.</p>\n<p class=\"say\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Dense retrieval handles meaning, but semantic similarity is not the same as factual or operational equivalence.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"co note rv interp-callout interp-engineering\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Key Principle\" data-i18n-zh=\"关键原则\">Key Principle</span></span><p><strong>Authorization before semantic similarity.</strong><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\" Unauthorized documents must not enter the model context.\" data-i18n-zh=\" 未经授权的文档不应进入模型上下文。\"> Unauthorized documents must not enter the model context.</span></p></div>\n</section>\n<details class=\"co note verification-note\" id=\"verification-02-20260928\"><summary class=\"co-t\">2026-09-28 · <span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verification boundaries\" data-i18n-zh=\"验证边界\">Verification boundaries</span></summary><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Exact normalization must preserve business identity, and ACLs cannot be relaxed for recall. Dense retrieval performance depends on the domain and model; GraphRAG also supports global questions through community summaries.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Exact 规范化必须保留业务身份差异；ACL 不可为 Recall 放宽。Dense 的相对表现依赖数据域与模型；GraphRAG 还可利用社区摘要回答全局问题。\">Exact normalization must preserve business identity, and ACLs cannot be relaxed for recall. Dense retrieval performance depends on the domain and model; GraphRAG also supports global questions through community summaries.</span></p><p><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08663\">BEIR</a></p></details>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"fde-verified-permission-rag-title\" id=\"fde-verified-permission-rag\"><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-verified-permission-rag-title\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Permission-Aware RAG: three independently verified interview answers\" data-i18n-zh=\"Permission-Aware RAG：三道有证据的面试题\">Permission-Aware RAG: three independently verified interview answers</span> <small>§2.FDE</small></h2><p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Enterprise RAG can fail through unauthorized reads before relevance failures. Separate trusted identity, candidate filtering, retrieval quality and permission propagation.\" data-i18n-zh=\"企业 RAG 最危险的失败未必是召回不足，而是越权读取。区分授权身份、候选集过滤、检索质量与数据权限更新。\">Enterprise RAG can fail through unauthorized reads before relevance failures. Separate trusted identity, candidate filtering, retrieval quality and permission propagation.</span></p><aside class=\"co note rv\"><span class=\"co-t\">SOURCE BOUNDARY</span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"These independently authored questions and answers derive from public FDE topics, not from any private paid answer. Platform facts follow first-party references; design advice is handbook synthesis.\" data-i18n-zh=\"以下是根据 FDE 网站公开考点独立撰写的问题与答案，不是付费题目的官方答案。产品细节以链接的官方文档为准；设计建议属于 Handbook 综合判断。\">These independently authored questions and answers derive from public FDE topics, not from any private paid answer. Platform facts follow first-party references; design advice is handbook synthesis.</span></p></aside><h3 id=\"fde-qa-auth\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q1 · How do you prevent cross-tenant RAG leakage?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q1 · 如何确保 RAG 不泄漏其他租户的文档？\">Q1 · How do you prevent cross-tenant RAG leakage?</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Validate the caller with trusted identity infrastructure and constrain eligible documents before reranking, prompting, caching or logging. The LLM cannot grant access.\" data-i18n-zh=\"由可信服务验证身份并计算有效权限，在检索前约束合法候选集；授权通过后才能进入 rerank、LLM context、缓存与日志。模型不能自行决定谁有权限。\">Validate the caller with trusted identity infrastructure and constrain eligible documents before reranking, prompting, caching or logging. The LLM cannot grant access.</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Trusted caller identity → policy/tenant scope\n→ authorized retrieval candidates\n→ authorized rerank → evidence → answer\n→ tenant-scoped cache, redacted traces</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"风险\">Risk</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Test\" data-i18n-zh=\"必须验证\">Test</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mixed-tenant documents\" data-i18n-zh=\"混合租户文档\">Mixed-tenant documents</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"No forbidden material in candidates, prompt or logs\" data-i18n-zh=\"候选集、Prompt、日志全部不出现越权文档\">No forbidden material in candidates, prompt or logs</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Stale ACL / shared cache\" data-i18n-zh=\"旧 ACL / 共享缓存\">Stale ACL / shared cache</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Revocation reflected in caches and source checks\" data-i18n-zh=\"撤权后缓存与源内容一致地拒绝访问\">Revocation reflected in caches and source checks</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Model-supplied tenant_id\" data-i18n-zh=\"模型传入 tenant_id\">Model-supplied tenant_id</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Agent cannot override trusted tenant identity\" data-i18n-zh=\"请求身份不得由模型覆盖\">Agent cannot override trusted tenant identity</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"核心判断\">Engineering rule</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A security filter is a query predicate, not authentication: Microsoft's string-based security trimming does not itself validate identity.\" data-i18n-zh=\"Security filter 是查询条件，不是认证机制。Azure 文档明确说明基于字符串的 security-trimming 不提供身份认证本身。\">A security filter is a query predicate, not authentication: Microsoft's string-based security trimming does not itself validate identity.</span></p></aside>\n<h3 id=\"fde-qa-pre-post\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q2 · What changes when you pre-filter versus post-filter vector search?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q2 · 向量检索的 Pre-filter 与 Post-filter 哪个更可靠？\">Q2 · What changes when you pre-filter versus post-filter vector search?</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If a user can see 1% of the index, global top-k followed by filtering can return nothing despite a valid answer in the authorized subset. Prefiltering improves authorized recall but may increase ANN traversal cost.\" data-i18n-zh=\"当用户只可见 1% 文档时，先全局 top-k 后过滤可能得到空结果，即使可访问集合内有答案。Pre-filter 可改善授权集合内召回，但高度选择性的过滤可能增加 ANN 遍历成本。\">If a user can see 1% of the index, global top-k followed by filtering can return nothing despite a valid answer in the authorized subset. Prefiltering improves authorized recall but may increase ANN traversal cost.</span></p>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mode\" data-i18n-zh=\"方法\">Mode</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Consequence\" data-i18n-zh=\"效果与取舍\">Consequence</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Pre-filter\" data-i18n-zh=\"Pre-filter\">Pre-filter</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Search eligible corpus; selective predicates can cost more\" data-i18n-zh=\"合法候选集内检索；选择性高时成本上涨\">Search eligible corpus; selective predicates can cost more</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Post-filter\" data-i18n-zh=\"Post-filter\">Post-filter</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ANN first; small k can miss permitted relevant documents\" data-i18n-zh=\"先 ANN 后过滤；小 k 易漏掉合法相关文档\">ANN first; small k can miss permitted relevant documents</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Strict post-filter (preview)\" data-i18n-zh=\"Strict post-filter（预览）\">Strict post-filter (preview)</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Filter global top-k; highest false-negative risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"全局 top-k 后过滤；对高选择性权限风险最大\">Filter global top-k; highest false-negative risk</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"fde-qa-revoke\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Q3 · How do you handle source ACL revocation after indexing?\" data-i18n-zh=\"Q3 · 权限撤销之后如何防止旧索引仍然放行？\">Q3 · How do you handle source ACL revocation after indexing?</span></h3>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Measure source-to-index ACL sync lag and reauthorize document fetches where necessary. Define revocation-to-denial objectives covering caches, async jobs and citations; fail closed for sensitive content when policy freshness is unknown.\" data-i18n-zh=\"追踪源权限到索引的同步窗口，必要时在取回源文档时重新授权；建立撤权到拒绝的 SLO，并对缓存、异步任务和引用执行隔离。无法确认权限版本时对敏感资源 fail closed。\">Measure source-to-index ACL sync lag and reauthorize document fetches where necessary. Define revocation-to-denial objectives covering caches, async jobs and citations; fail closed for sensitive content when policy freshness is unknown.</span></p>\n<aside class=\"co must rv\"><span class=\"co-t\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Engineering rule\" data-i18n-zh=\"核心判断\">Engineering rule</span></span><p><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Critical regression: after Alice loses access, neither the index, cache nor downstream tool may return the revoked document.\" data-i18n-zh=\"最关键的回归测试：Alice 已撤权，搜索索引、缓存和下游工具都不能再次向她提供旧文档。\">Critical regression: after Alice loses access, neither the index, cache nor downstream tool may return the revoked document.</span></p></aside>\n<p class=\"rv\"><small><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verified first-party sources\" data-i18n-zh=\"官方核验来源\">Verified first-party sources</span>: <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-document-level-access-overview\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Azure document ACL</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/search-security-trimming-for-azure-search\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Security trimming</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/vector-search-filters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Vector filter modes</a> · <a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/search/hybrid-search-how-to-query\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hybrid override</a></small></p></section>\n</div>", "sections": [{"id": "comparison", "zh": "能力对比", "en": "Comparison"}, {"id": "fde-verified-permission-rag-title", "zh": "Permission-Aware RAG：三道有证据的面试题 §2.FDE", "en": "Permission-Aware RAG: three independently verified interview answers"}], "supplements": ["fde-verified-permission-rag"]}